# 🕸️ KSP Sentinel AI — Phase 2: Graph Intelligence Tool-Calling Agent & Network Analysis Engine

## 1. Executive Problem & Core Grounding Principle

> **Core Grounding Rule**:  
> The Chatbot **cannot and must not invent or hallucinate relationships**.  
> Questions like *"How is Person X connected to Crime Person Y?"* can **only** be answered if and when a verified dataset is loaded and locked in Crime Analytics, via a **Deterministic Graph Tool-Calling Agent**.

If no relational dataset is locked in Crime Analytics, the Chatbot refuses to guess and informs the officer:
> *"No active relational dataset loaded. Please upload a dataset in Crime Data Analytics or connect a database to trace entity networks."*

